# The image contains dependencies, a reviewed Circos patch and the licensed font. Runtime source
# is mounted for testing/use. Keep credentials, Git metadata, results and caches
# out of the build context, including untracked files on a maintainer's laptop.
**
!Dockerfile
!fonts
!fonts/LiberationSans-Bold.ttf
!fonts/LICENSE.LiberationSans
!patches
!patches/circos-zero-width-svg.patch
!patches/NOTICE.md
!patches/LICENSE.Circos
